{"study_accession":"PRJNA835151","secondary_study_accession":"SRP373683","title":"Antigen-specific CD8 T cells against SARS-CoV-2","description":"In this project, we characterized the antigen-specific CD8 T cells of people from five groups. We used HLA:A2 tetramers loaded with the GILGFVFTL (Influenza) or YLQPRTFLL (Sars-CoV-2) peptides to label cells. Cells were sorted based on CD3+CD8+TTM+. We distinguished between four groups: 1. SARS2-TTM+ cells 6 months after infection, 2. SARS2-TTM+ cells 1 motnhs after 2nd vaccination with the Pfizer vaccine, 3. SARS2-TTM+ cells of people that were both infected and vaccinated and 4. FLU-TTM+ cells. Cells were sorted and analyzed by bulk RNA sequencing. Overall design: We characterized the antigen-specific CD8 T cells of people from five groups. We used HLA:A2 tetramers loaded with the GILGFVFTL (Influenza) or YLQPRTFLL (Sars-CoV-2) peptides to label cells. Cells were sorted based on CD3+CD8+TTM+. We distinguished between four groups: 1. SARS2-TTM+ cells 6 months after infection, 2. SARS2-TTM+ cells 1 motnhs after 2nd vaccination with the Pfizer vaccine, 3. SARS2-TTM+ cells of people that were both infected and vaccinated and 4. FLU-TTM+ cells. Cells were sorted and analyzed by bulk RNA sequencing.","pubmed":"37099427","geo_series":"","n_samples":18,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN28094679","study_accession":"PRJNA835151","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"C19-specific cells, infected and 1 month post 2nd vaccine, rep.4","description":"C19-specific cells, infected and 1 month post 2nd vaccine, rep.4","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM6107451","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2023-04-14","attributes":[["source_name","PBMC"],["tissue","PBMC"],["cell_type","CD8+ T cells"],["genotype","SARS-2 specific cells"],["treatment","Infected and 1 month after 2nd vaccination (Pfizer)"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR19088077","experiment_accession":"SRX15157763","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection"